{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1JN","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"約翰一書","commonName":"約翰一書","title":"約翰一書","order":62,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"e6e4f4db7f62ecdacae15801e41e4e152d836d2afb5474c8d8ba460f3f477571","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1JN/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["生命之道"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["論到從起初原有的生命之道，就是我們所聽見、所看見、親眼看過、親手摸過的。（"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["這生命已經顯現出來，我們也看見過，現在又作見證，將原與父同在、且顯現與我們那永遠的生命傳給你們。）"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我們將所看見、所聽見的傳給你們，使你們與我們相交。我們乃是與父並他兒子耶穌基督相交的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我們將這些話寫給你們，使你們",{"noteId":0},"的喜樂充足。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝就是光"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["上帝就是光，在他毫無黑暗。這是我們從主所聽見、又報給你們的信息。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我們若說是與上帝相交，卻仍在黑暗裏行，就是說謊話，不行真理了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我們若在光明中行，如同上帝在光明中，就彼此相交，他兒子耶穌的血也洗淨我們一切的罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我們若說自己無罪，便是自欺，真理不在我們心裏了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我們若認自己的罪，上帝是信實的，是公義的，必要赦免我們的罪，洗淨我們一切的不義。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我們若說自己沒有犯過罪，便是以上帝為說謊的，他的道也不在我們心裏了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"有古卷：我們","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1JN/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2PE/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}